{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:55:08+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:55:08+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Bilfinger SE","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","country":"Germany","city":"Mannheim","website":"https://www.bilfinger.com","employees":31323,"summary":"Bilfinger SE provides industrial services to customers in the process industry primarily in Europe, North America, and the Middle East. It operates through three segments: Engineering & Maintenance Europe; Engineering & Maintenance International; and Technologies. The company offers engineering, project, maintenance, turnaround, rotating equipment, inspection, insulation, scaffolding, corrosion protection, mechanical, electrical, instrumentation, control, digital services, and decommissioning of nuclear power plants. It also provides services in the field of nuclear energy, battery production, district heating and waste heat, hydropower, waste recycling and wastewater treatment, hydrogen, carbon capture and storage, wind power, biogas, and environmental tech. In addition, the company offers consulting and engineering; prefabrication and installation; and access and insulation services, as well as maintenance, engineering, extension, new construction, and operation of industrial plants. The company serves customers in energy, chemicals and petrochemicals, pharma and biopharma, and oil and gas industries. Bilfinger SE was founded in 1880 and is headquartered in Mannheim, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Bilfinger SE fournit des services industriels à des clients de l'industrie de transformation principalement en Europe, en Amérique du Nord et au Moyen-Orient. Elle opère à travers trois segments : Engineering & Maintenance Europe ; Engineering & Maintenance International ; et Technologies. La société offre des ser